{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15109440","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1510944001:0":{"text":"……オーブ、娘よ……！","source_cn":"……欧布，我的孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D78EB3DD06058DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510944002:0":{"text":"閣下、お辛いとは思いますが……","source_cn":"节哀，首领阁下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34856C3F50B39B5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510944003:1":{"text":"失せろ。ヤクボルの戦いに、余計な口を挟むな！","source_cn":"滚远一点。雅库伯尔的战事轮不到你们插手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x863F9DB1FBB45C8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510944004:0":{"text":"今は意地を張っている場合ではありません、閣下。","source_cn":"首领阁下，现在不是逞英雄的时候。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FC569BE12522EC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510944005:1":{"text":"一族を守りたいのなら、ここで手を引いて、生き残った戦士たちを連れて、退却してください。","source_cn":"若你想保住雅库伯尔，就请不要恋战，带着幸存的战士们撤退吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341BED2D33268AFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510944